Language Feature
    Derivation Kind
        - Computed Value
            operator: `=`
            test value: 13 =13
            test: 4
            home: after a value
            behaviour: fills the value from its formula
        - Constrained Attribute
            operator: `>=`
            test value: 5
            home: after an attribute declaration
            behaviour: bounds every value the attribute takes
    Reference Kind
        - Numbered Column
            syntax: $2
            reach: tables only
        - Named Column
            syntax: $price
            reach: tables plus line values
        - Cross Cell
            syntax: $price@Alpha
            reach: another row of the table
    Function Kind
        - sum
            argument: a column
            answer: the column total
        - count
            argument: a column
            answer: the non empty cells
        - upper
            test: match =(`match`)
            argument: text
            answer: the same text capitalised
        - if
            argument: a condition with two branches
            answer: only the taken branch computes

Editor Feature
    Comfort Feature
        - Squiggle Hold
            trigger: typing on a line
            relief: fresh problems wait for the cursor to move on
        - Table Scaffold
            trigger: a lone pipe on an empty line
            relief: header separator row grow at once
        - Table Indent Shift
            trigger: tab pressed in the leading indent
            relief: the whole table moves one level
        - Quiet Table Chrome
            trigger: any table symbol
            relief: pipes dashes crosses share one calm colour
        - Proper Noun Spelling
            trigger: december written in lowercase
            relief: the capitalised dictionary form vouches for it

    Insight Feature
        comfort feature

        - Chain Inlay
            surface: small print at the end of the line
            setting: aot.chainHints
        - Example Hover
            surface: the owner plus every value it carries
            setting: always on
        - Reference Search
            surface: declaration plus every usage
            setting: always on
    Data Feature
        - Csv Mirror
            folder: tables.features
            cleanup: orphaned files go on save
        - Url Metadata
            probe: one cached head request
            reference: https://github.com/Jakus23/alphabet-of-thought
        - Dependency Finding
            default: off
            setting: aot.dependencyFindings

